title Manage Incoming Correspondence

component correspondence-webapp as "Correspondence Workspace" web-application
component public-sla-dashboard as "Public SLA Dashboard" web-application
component correspondence-api as "Correspondence API" service
component correspondence-db as "Correspondence Database" database

east correspondence-auth as "Thunder Auth" identity-server
south aws-s3 as "S3 File Storage" service
south email-service as "Email Service" service
south sms-service as "SMS Service" service
south email-intake as "Email Intake Provider" service

north -> correspondence-webapp
north -> public-sla-dashboard

correspondence-webapp -> correspondence-api
correspondence-webapp -> correspondence-auth

public-sla-dashboard -> correspondence-api

correspondence-api -> correspondence-auth
correspondence-api -> correspondence-db
correspondence-api -> aws-s3
correspondence-api -> email-service
correspondence-api -> sms-service
correspondence-api -> email-intake
